      "post_click_text": "\n\t\n\nVersion 1.41\n\nFri Aug 21, 2020 20:29\nCash: $ 300\n\nDay 0 of 303\n\nSAVES\nRESTART\n\t\t\nStatus\tExperience\tInventory\nPersonal Status\nEnergy\t:\t\n95 %\n\nHygiene\t:\t\n55 %\n\nMorale\t:\t\n100 %\n\nLiberal\t:\t\n0 %\n\nLust\t:\t\n0 %\n\nLooks\t:\t\n30 %\n\nTanned\t:\t\n0 %\n\nIntellect\t:\t\n20 %\n\nFitness\t:\t\n20 %\n\nWeight\t:\t60 kg (132 lbs)\nTits size\t:\tNormal\nButt size\t:\tNormal\nReputation\t:\tNone\n\t\t\nAddictions\nCocaine\t:\tnone\nWeed\t:\tnone\nAlcohol\t:\tnone\nSex\t:\tnone\nIntoxication\nDrunk\t:\t\n0 %\n\nDrugs\t:\t\n0 %\n\nMistakes\nTests failed\t:\t0\n\n\n\n  \n\nThe Arrival\n\nYou get off the bus and start walking to the apartment building in front of you. Your parents managed to get a small apartment here for you for the year to come.\n\nThe only person in Tulagi your family knows is a distant uncle, who you do not remember meeting.\n\nYour landlady is Mrs. Love and every Monday you have to pay the rent of $ 100 cash to her. Go to collect the key from her.\n\nEnergy -5 , Hygiene -5\nWelcome to this game!",
